    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="7" relname="span">I agree with you 100% on the point that MS has its advantages by being quite flexible with other MS products.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="volitional-result">This makes it so easy for the consumer/end-user when working on this platform.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="8" relname="span">Practically every MS product in the Office Suite "speaks" to eachother in a sense.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="evidence">Everything can be imported, exported, merged, etc.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="8" relname="evaluation">This is a wonderful benefit to any user.</segment>
        <group id="6" type="span"/>
        <group id="7" type="span" parent="6" relname="span"/>
        <group id="8" type="span" parent="9" relname="span"/>
